From: Kiro Agent <244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 19:31:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(rebrand): rename dograh services module to omni

Renames src/pipecat/services/dograh -> omni, classes Dograh*->Omni*
(LLM/STT/TTS/FluxSTT + settings), OMNI_TTFS_P constant, internal import
paths, and prose. Leaves services.dograh.com base URLs pending domain move.
